WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
VBGRAMG operators.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.760
One hundred workers.

3
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.720
Two hundred.

4
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:05.440
More.

5
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.580
Same details, again and again.

6
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.600
It takes time.

7
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.540
It's a headache.

8
00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.745
Here's an easier way.

9
00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.145
The Panchayat Secretary

10
00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:14.285
sends the worker list

11
00:00:14.285 --> 00:00:15.385
from the Android app

12
00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:17.185
straight to the office.

13
00:00:17.185 --> 00:00:18.285
The data entry operator

14
00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:19.225
gets a notification

15
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:21.085
in the desktop app.

16
00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:22.085
Open it.

17
00:00:22.085 --> 00:00:24.195
Review the list.

18
00:00:24.195 --> 00:00:25.075
The app checks

19
00:00:25.075 --> 00:00:27.415
eKYC, ABPS

20
00:00:27.415 --> 00:00:29.015
and Aadhaar availability,

21
00:00:29.015 --> 00:00:29.755
helping you choose

22
00:00:29.755 --> 00:00:31.495
workers who qualify.

23
00:00:31.495 --> 00:00:32.615
Check the demand,

24
00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:33.835
then send it.

25
00:00:33.835 --> 00:00:34.535
The app creates

26
00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:35.975
Work Demands automatically

27
00:00:35.975 --> 00:00:39.370
and checks they're saved.

28
00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.490
One list.

29
00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.670
Less typing.

30
00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:42.490
Let the app handle

31
00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:43.870
the repeated entry.

32
00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:44.770
Save time for

33
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.590
secretaries and operators.

34
00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:47.570
Fewer trips.

35
00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:49.290
Lower travel costs.

36
00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.210
Work Demand and Muster Roll.

37
00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.590
Free to download.

38
00:00:52.590 --> 00:01:00.000
Try your next worker list.

